{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33220","headline":"早春残雪 · 裴虔余","name":"早春残雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霁日雕琼彩，幽庭减夜寒。\n梅飘余片积，日堕晚光残。\n零落偏依桂，霏微不掩兰。\n阴林披雾縠，小沼破冰盘。\n曲槛霜凝砌，疎篁玉碎竿。\n已闻三径好，犹可访袁安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴虔余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}